# Number Guessing Game

## Description
A simple number guessing game built using Python.

## How to Play
- Computer selects a random number between 1 and 100.
- User gets 7 attempts to guess the number.
- The game gives hints: Too High or Too Low.
- Displays the result when the game ends.

## Technologies Used
- Python

